<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Roadside Assist | Help is on the way</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <%- include('./partials/navbar') %>
    <main class="home-page">
      <section class="home-hero">
        <div class="home-hero__content">
          <p class="eyebrow">Roadside help, made human</p>
          <h1>When the road gets rough, we've got you.</h1>
          <p>Quick, dependable support for the unexpected moments between here and there.</p>
          <a class="button-link" href="/requests/new">Get roadside help</a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="services-section" aria-labelledby="services-heading">
        <div class="services-section__heading">
          <p class="eyebrow">A little help goes a long way</p>
          <h2 id="services-heading">Here for the bumps in the road</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="services-grid">
          <article class="service-card">
            <span class="service-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">🛞</span>
            <h3>Flat tire?</h3>
            <p>Get help changing a tire and get back to your plans.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="service-card">
            <span class="service-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">🔋</span>
            <h3>Dead battery?</h3>
            <p>We’ll help get your car started and your day moving again.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="service-card">
            <span class="service-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">⛽</span>
            <h3>Out of fuel?</h3>
            <p>A little fuel can make a big difference. Request assistance.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
